    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d106">

                <pb facs="d105-20" n="20" sameAs="frus:frus1958-60v03mSupp/d105-20"/>

                <head>106. Memorandum From Gleason to the NSC Planning Board<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d106-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1958-11-05">November 5,
                        1958</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <pb facs="d106-1" n="1" type="facsimile" xml:id="d106-1"/>
                <list subtype="subject" type="description">
                    <label>SUBJECT</label>
                    <item>Review of NSC 5410/1</item>
                </list>
                <list type="references">
                    <head>REFERENCES</head>
                    <item>A. NSC 5410/1</item>
                    <item>B. NSC 5810/1</item>
                    <item>C. Memos for Planning Board, May 16 and October 17, 1958</item>
                    <item>D. Record of Meeting of Planning Board, October 17, 1958</item>
                </list>
                <p>As a result of discussion by the drafting committee constituted by the Planning
                    Board on October 17 (Reference D), the enclosed alternative policy statements on
                    the subject are transmitted herewith <pb facs="0469" n="364" type="typeset"
                        xml:id="pg364"/> for consideration by the Planning Board at its meeting on
                    Friday, November 7, 1958.</p>
                <p>Alternative A is a draft revision of NSC 5410/1 submitted by the Defense and JCS
                    members of the drafting committee. Other members of the drafting committee feel
                    that it might be preferable to deal with the substance of NSC 5410/1 along the
                    lines of Alternative B, which is in the form of a draft Annex to NSC 5810/1.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">Marion W. Boggs</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Director</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Policy Coordinating Secretariat</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>



                <xi:include href="d106-a1.xml" xpointer="d106-a1"/>
                <xi:include href="d106-a2.xml" xpointer="d106-a2"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
